WEBVTT

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:08.040
Please do the mind.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:00.320
Tonight.

00:01:52.588 --> 00:01:53.088
Hold it

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:00.900
Hurry up and let Atom meet the robot!

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:04.600
Well, well, lady, calm down.

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:07.040
Atom, do you have something on your mind?

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:08.580
I came here because I was busy!

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:09.900
Did you do something?

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:11.520
Hey, Atom.

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:13.480
Atom?

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:16.080
Yes, but...

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:17.800
Listen carefully, Atom!

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:21.340
Our robot farm has been shaking since last night!

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:22.500
It's shaking!

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:23.420
Yes!

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:27.270
The neighbors in the nearby town are also scared and won't come!

00:02:27.510 --> 00:02:29.870
At this rate, the robot farm will be messed up!

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:34.860
I heard from my grandpa that Atom is the best robot.

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:38.640
You should be able to do something about it.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.410
Wait a minute. Is your grandpa also in that robot farm?

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:46.800
My grandpa was crushed by a tomato because of the mess.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:48.360
He got hurt.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:50.630
Crushed by a tomato?

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:56.960
Grandma, did you see it in your dreams?

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:58.560
It's a joke!

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:02.540
If the cucumber was a cucumber, Grandpa might have been dead!

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:09.080
Damn it!

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:16.900
What's your name?

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:20.220
Where is the robot farm?

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.640
I'll help you with something!

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:25.410
Oh...

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.140
I'm Mimi from the Rainbow Valley.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:33.520
The robot farm is in the Rainbow Valley.

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:37.410
Maid, where are you going?

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.380
I'm going to the robot farm in the Rainbow Valley.

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:44.540
What?

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:50.400
Don't talk to me.

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:52.280
What if they're bad people?

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:54.350
It's okay.

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:56.990
They're kind and nice people.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.690
What a fool you are.

00:03:58.690 --> 00:03:59.110
What are you doing?

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.400
I don't know what you're up to in your heart.

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:05.040
It's easy to believe in people.

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:06.140
It's a big deal.

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:07.630
Let's go.

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:12.860
Atom, you're going to eat, aren't you?

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:13.910
Uh, yeah.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:22.800
Did you go to the robot farm?

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:27.490
But that's where the unique robots are.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:28.130
I'm making something unbelievable.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:29.070
I'm making something that can't be eaten.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:30.640
It's a great farm.

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:31.550
That's right.

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:33.570
It's a surprise farm.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:38.820
If that works, it will be a wonderful farm where humans and robots work together to complete it.

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:44.260
But the security guard said that the farm was shaking.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:44.440
It's shaking.

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:47.080
What is this?

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:52.690
It's the most revolutionary device in robot farming.

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:54.180
It's an environmental control tower.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:58.740
It uses geothermal energy to control weather conditions with electromagnetic waves.

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:04.980
Could something have happened to this device?

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:08.330
Wow, that's amazing!

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:13.240
Dr. Toneriko, the grandfather of Mimmy, developed that device by himself!

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:16.670
That's right! The grandfather is a genius scientist!

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:20.130
Oh, that's a lake that used to be cold.

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:23.050
The climate around here is unstable.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.150
Without an environmental control device,

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:27.630
we wouldn't have been able to make a farm for that person.

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:34.590
When we came to the valley for the first time, it was really a terrible land.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:38.080
Only the ruins and the old dams remained.

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:41.260
We immediately started the construction of the environmental control tower.

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:46.040
At night, I helped with the improvement of the seeds that were growing in the field.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.210
I also cultivated the lost land from scratch.

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:55.410
And finally, the environmental control tower Asagao Island was completed, and finally the vegetable making began.

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:59.510
After many years, this valley, which was an abandoned land, was...

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:00.840
They were reborn as the rainbow valley.

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:06.940
Then, those vegetables are Mimi's treasures, right?

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.260
That's the rainbow valley.

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:24.800
It's so big!

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:27.290
Grandpa, these are my dream vegetables.

00:06:27.810 --> 00:06:29.620
One tomato and ketchup.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.500
I can eat 100 of them!

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:35.660
This is Vegeta!

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:36.440
Hello!

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:37.960
Hello!

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:54.860
I'm Vegeta!

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:26.110
I knew it. This is the first time I've ever seen a ghost.

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:28.060
Mi, are you okay?

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:42.140
Even though I was finally able to acquire it, the treasure that we raised so preciously...

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:45.990
It's all my fault!

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:50.720
It's all my fault for using Katari, Katari, Katari!

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:51.880
Mimi!

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.900
Dr. Toneriko, who is Katari?

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:59.070
What happened?

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:08.040
About a week ago, a young man named Katari suddenly appeared.

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:14.100
He was a bright and bright young man, and Mimi immediately became like a brother.

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:24.440
And last night, Mimi, who trusted Katari, led him to Asagao Island.

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:48.690
Thank you, Mimi. I wanted to take a look inside.

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:02.920
This is the control room of the environment control device.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:18.230
Hey, stop!

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:43.460
Mimi is like that.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:50.410
The story is still in there.

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:54.330
No matter how many times I try to contact him, there's no answer.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:58.460
What the hell are you doing this for?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:00.380
What are you talking about?

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:05.950
What is this?

00:10:06.010 --> 00:10:08.520
Has the enemy started something again?

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:21.260
The environmental control device has completely started to break down.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:24.490
Then take Mimi and evacuate to a nearby town.

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:28.000
Mimi, hurry up and evacuate!

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:49.060
I'm going crazy

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:19.500
You guys, lend me your hands!

00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:22.080
I can't control this rampage anymore!

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:24.320
I have no choice but to directly control the heart in the basement!

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.560
What are you talking about?!

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:29.120
You're the one who made the device rampage!

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:32.370
Is that how you thought of me?

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:37.200
Last night, I looked at the data here and realized something was wrong with the device.

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.890
It was a time of struggle.

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:43.060
I'll do something about it before the device goes out of control.

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:46.360
That girl didn't say anything!

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:49.620
You respect your grandfather very much, don't you?

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:53.070
If you say that I have a defect in the device developed by the professor at that time,

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:55.410
did you believe me?

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:57.910
Atom, don't believe what he says!

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:08.260
Mimi! What's the point of me destroying the device?

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:14.290
If I were to steal this program, I would have escaped long ago yesterday!

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:16.140
I won't let this happen!

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:20.500
Mimi, what I told you the other day is true!

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:26.960
Mimi, as long as you're fine, I want to keep working at this robot farm.

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:29.680
You and the professor...

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:31.470
I want to live with Vegeta and the others.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:36.780
I just want to protect the robot farm.

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:39.370
Mimi! Atom!

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:40.840
Don't you trust me?

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:44.150
I don't know.

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:46.790
Let's go!

00:12:47.210 --> 00:12:48.820
Thank you, Atom!

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:49.440
This way!

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:51.080
Mimi, wait!

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:55.300
Video of the rainbow team on the satellite.

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:57.490
Earthquake has spread to the surrounding area.

00:12:57.670 --> 00:12:59.330
The earthquake has stimulated the downpour of the ground.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:04.800
I'm sure there's an old dam in the northern part of the Rainbow Valley.

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:09.140
The dam's water level must be rising rapidly due to the storm.

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:11.260
What if there's a landslide due to an earthquake?

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:13.250
The dam will collapse at once.

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:15.670
We need to send out an emergency alert immediately.

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.480
Hurry up! We're running out of time!

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:51.640
You're fine, but what about Mimi?

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:59.870
She caused a huge commotion in this farm, and now she's in this...

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:01.420
Robots are known to be dangerous and evil.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:03.500
What?

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:06.600
I'm glad you came, Atom.

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:09.730
If we can't stop this group's rampage,

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:14.040
the people of the world will definitely be disappointed in Super Robots.

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:19.030
From the beginning, Vegeta and the robots were going to commit a crime.

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:21.940
You robots steal human jobs,

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:24.430
make humans lazy and corrupt.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.080
Remember that!

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:29.610
In this world, there are humans who hate robots.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.330
There are a lot of people.

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:37.700
I hate robots.

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:44.680
I was fooled again.

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:50.110
Why do you believe in people so easily?

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:51.130
I finally understand.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.910
Robots don't have a heart.

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:56.670
I don't have a heart.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:58.350
I don't care if I'm lied to or betrayed.

00:14:58.710 --> 00:14:59.970
I don't care if I'm lied to or betrayed.

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:37.980
Doctor, the dam barrier is a matter of time.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:44.360
At this rate, Nijinotani won't last long, and even the town of Minami, Perm Town, will be engulfed by the Dark Dragon.

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:46.730
We must immediately evacuate the residents!

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:48.350
Yes, sir!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:50.430
The rescue helicopter has arrived at the robot farm!

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:55.690
Hurry up! The dam is about to break through!

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.460
Everyone, hurry up and get on this!

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:01.300
Grandpa, what's going on?

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:04.420
Vegeta and the others...

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:08.610
What happened to everyone at a time like this?

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:12.200
What's wrong? Did everyone break down?

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:15.960
That can't be! Vegeta and the others have never broken down!

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:16.860
I've never seen anything like this before!

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:27.100
Kappachi is...

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:29.100
Atom...

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:29.970
Vege...

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.640
Vegeta and the others can hear the sirens, and they know the flood is coming!

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:36.510
But they don't want to leave this farm!

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:42.080
Vegeta and the robots like this farm, so...

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:45.500
You guys run away!

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:47.280
But Vegeta and the others...

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:49.880
I know! I'll protect Vegeta and the others!

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:52.040
Atom...

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:04.880
What's wrong, Adam? Run away now!

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:11.860
Let's protect this farm together!

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:15.340
Everyone, lend me a hand!

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:10.740
What are you going to do?

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:12.650
That's right.

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:16.240
All of a sudden, the robots started rampaging and destroyed all of the agricultural equipment.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:22.090
Even the Atom, which boasts of science and technology, couldn't stop the robots from rampaging.

00:18:22.690 --> 00:18:29.910
Thanks to that, Dr. Toneriko and her granddaughter, Mimi-chan, the robots...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:30.260
I was sacrificed.

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:33.050
I'm alive.

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:40.540
I'm alive.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:44.940
I was buried in Asagao Island.

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:56.700
Atom is going to lead the water of the dam to the lake.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:13.000
What?

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:16.290
Chiru is making a big curve in the pond.

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:17.500
Switch the monitor.

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:19.130
What?

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:21.420
It's impossible to bend the curve with the momentum of this terrible water.

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:28.980
Is that so?

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:33.060
Then the main dragon will jump out of the water and directly hit the farmland!

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:33.660
Huh?

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:35.660
Monitor, zoom up!

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:36.140
Yes!

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:40.230
You did a good job.

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:45.130
Professor, there are people in this world who hate robots.

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:47.830
Yeah, unfortunately.

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:56.490
Listen, if you keep the robots as they are, human beings will be destroyed one day.

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:03.220
After all, it's a group of extremists who are anti-robots.

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:05.230
They finally started to move.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:10.440
I can do it again as many times as I want if I'm with Vegeta and the others.

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:12.900
Yeah, it's okay if it's Mimi.

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:16.110
I'm sorry, Atomo.

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:16.490
What?

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:20.090
I said something terrible just now.

00:21:20.310 --> 00:21:24.290
Robots have the same heart as humans, don't they?

00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:25.160
Wow!

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:27.840
Big rainbow!

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:34.920
Beautiful rainbow

00:22:12.730 --> 00:22:21.320
Why, why does my heart hurt and I cry?

00:22:22.680 --> 00:22:28.660
Why, why do my tears fall?

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:33.940
When you run, you'll be alone

00:22:33.940 --> 00:22:37.410
Hold your small knees

00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:46.770
Look up at the distance again

00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:54.080
Solar 3

00:23:00.090 --> 00:23:05.050
It's high, it's high, it's high

00:23:09.830 --> 00:23:29.770
The robot, ATRAS, has come to challenge me, Tenma

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:30.840
What are you trying to do?

00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:32.390
Next time on

00:23:32.390 --> 00:23:35.110
The Future of Catch with Your Heart
